==Russian==

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|LL-Q7737 (rus)-Tatiana Kerbush-пост.wav|a=Saint Petersburg}}

===Etymology 1===
Old Russian and pre-Reform {{m|ru|постъ}}, as it were {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*postъ}}, a loan from  {{der|ru|goh|fasta||fast}} (8th century, a feminine  noun  from the root of {{der|ru|gem-pro|*fastāną}}), presumably first in this sense in {{cog|got|𐍆𐌰𐍃𐍄𐌰𐌽}}, gloss of {{m|grc|νηστεία}}.

====Noun====
{{ru-noun+|b|loc=в [[посту́]],в [[посте́]]}}

# [[fast]] {{gloss|period of restricted eating}}
#: {{uxi|ru|великий '''пост'''|Great Lent (''lit.'' great '''fast''')}}

=====Declension=====
{{ru-noun-table|b|loc=в [[посту́]],в [[посте́]]}}

=====Related terms=====
* {{l|ru|пости́ться}}
* {{l|ru|по́стный}}

===Etymology 2===
[[Image:Guard Prague Castle 0451.jpg|thumb|пост]]
From the {{bor|ru|fr|poste}}, ca. 1700.

====Noun====
{{ru-noun+|b|loc=на [[посту́]]|adj=постово́й}}

# [[post]], [[office]], [[appointment]], [[position]], [[job]]
# [[picket]], [[outpost]], [[guard post]], [[station]]

